# Jarvis Voice tasks. herd task file: one task per line, as  <branch> [@persona]: <prompt>
#   - Only the first ":" splits the line, so prompts can contain colons.
#   - Each prompt must fit on one line.
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with # are skipped.
#   - The branch name also names the agent (fix/foo-bar -> fix-foo-bar). Keep it short and unique.
#   - @persona prepends that persona's prompt (herd personas lists them). One persona per line.
#
# herd -f starts EVERY uncommented line at once, so this file is the run sheet:
#   - Uncommented  = ready to start now.
#   - #branch ...  = held. Prompt kept intact. Delete the leading # when its gate clears.
#
# Run:   herd -f Tasks.herd        (add -w to wait for all of them)
# Check: herd -n -f Tasks.herd to see what would start, herd ls for what is running
# Homelab: a line that says it works in homelab-gitops must not start from here, or it lands in this
#        repo's worktree. Copy that one line, without its #, to a scratch file and run
#        herd -r ~/git/homelab-gitops -f <file>. herd does not read tasks from stdin when spawning.
# Clean: herd done <branch>   (after the PR merges). On this GitHub repo it stops at "no PR into main",
#        even with -F, for want of an fj token. Check the PR by hand, herd rm, delete the remote branch.
#
# Before starting anything: git worktree list. Items here have run in parallel sessions before.
# This repo is public: no internal addresses, phone numbers or secrets in anything a task commits.
# Personas come from ~/.config/herd/personas (symlinks into the vault's 80 Personas).
#
# Rewritten 2026-10-30, tasks 11-20 added and moved to herd format 2026-10-31. Tasks 11-13 updated
# and 21-22 added 2026-10-31 from Grayfield's gateway review (REVIEW.md on main, #235). Supersedes
# "2026-10-11 - Jarvis Voice - Backlog Starter Prompts.md" (items 1 and 3) and the Jarvis Voice
# lines in Work Tracker.md. Next phase set 2026-11-01, after the normal-load run (#239) and the
# gateway rework (#240). Refreshed the same day, after Task 12's findings (#244) and #247, and
# again once I took fast-tier.md's recommendations, and again after the voice arm reported (#252).
# Refreshed 2026-11-02, after step 3 (#254), the probe fixes (#257), 3a (#260) and server-v0.32.2.
# Replanned the same day: see REPLAN below. It overrides anything older it disagrees with.
