ird-party call audio is stored and for how long. - Which lab and live rules apply: credentials on each channel, and whether lab gets dialling at all. Constraints: Hargrove rates and names risks, the decisions stay mine. DONE WHEN: I approve the design, or we decide not to build and park tasks 15-20.

