 with finding 5's alerts, and cover the Spark in the 3 AM section), and R5 (see Minor). Carry the review's "Not verified here" items into the doc as open items, not as findings. Constraints: per Atlas, every claim cites a source. Do not re-run anything, cite Task 11 and label its figures as not re-run. This repo is public. DONE WHEN: all four blockers are cleared and the doc lists what I still have to decide, with no finalist other than LiteLLM.

